  "attribution": "來源：《焦氏易林》，易學網《焦氏易林［四庫全書版］》（依據版本：《欽定四庫全書》子部術數類），https://www.eee-learning.com/book/giauii 。依來源要求標示出處及原網頁連結；本站僅整理林辭原文，並記錄收錄、標點及文字整理修改。",
  "entryCount": 64,
  "missingTargets": [],
  "entries": [
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 51,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 51,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 51,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 51,
      "hexagramName": "震",
      "poemText": "枯瓠不朽，利以濟舟。渡踰江海，無有溺憂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:5f8c8c6dad83affd89cc75dd8e10e5b38b0a989b5ca78e7270b3f05c5855b6df",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f91f117d97f0cd541a68425c662cbc4b40bb893921cabeb3efa30f3332624d7d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 51,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 1,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 1,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 1,
      "hexagramName": "乾",
      "poemText": "陷塗溺水，火燒我履，憂患重累。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0a81f671bc2d818c9e79251e203eb0a900f0bd840b1da47f6c7d85b5fd70cca5",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1cfd95997acd428a8ec8928c81c843bfe475c7e9c60f7046a659e1e23f1998a7"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 51,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 2,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 2,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 2,
      "hexagramName": "坤",
      "poemText": "旦生夕死，名曰嬰鬼，不可得祀。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:26a567c53dab6608d60812f0d9b47a44c13ac498313c0213a382c6588af2b3ff",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ccd079ae21776ffc95015357826e9056baf7a627779fdb2aa96b58d436dbd41a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 51,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 3,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 3,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 3,
      "hexagramName": "屯",
      "poemText": "揚水潛鑿，使石潔白。衣素表朱，遊戲皋澤。得君所願，心志娛樂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6e73df8c1b2a559ba5ecd557ff8d6050770816af43a781fc7a41a0dbc11502c2",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:8deb1cf660727e9d23e108b0d6f54b1d7c3571ddffd00b74588a5a4e9c0aeae6"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 51,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 4,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 4,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 4,
      "hexagramName": "蒙",
      "poemText": "眾鳥所翔，呼有大怪。九身無頭，魂驚魄去。不可以居。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:af3cf0060973f89999c79839005753eb972f2d4cd285a964cb7e59831218c69b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5e7ba68180f176b831dfea3f43b557ff31cb8911a8c11b89d7765686ed7bc96a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 51,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 5,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 5,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 5,
      "hexagramName": "需",
      "poemText": "刖根枯株，不生肌膚。病在於心，身以燋枯。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1bf0a056a1ad25d192eee83475c9a5b41f048a3e4f6b65b4a4a0eeb0996e3165",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:0089e00dfdbedc62188b0df8d93c4009e3b6a6a07bfde90d80186d0fcb286e55"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 51,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 6,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 6,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 6,
      "hexagramName": "訟",
      "poemText": "府藏之富，王以振貧。捕魚河海，罟網多得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:974ced055a2a80046934ec49f0099306efb05fa253bd80eaa424c69e933bd72c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:57c68dcf402e521b9dc51be333c1ca44fdf3950957435d71992bee2b56ba5f6f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 51,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 7,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 7,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 7,
      "hexagramName": "師",
      "poemText": "一莖九躔，更用牽攣。安明俯仰，不得東西。讚讞當決，日午被刑。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3c6cfe8f53c956e162a4893416031df6db80f5a2dd2f167319b5514e3cfb3d8f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3ce790313d6e21a2c14d29e9a85d8a175293184aff70b1cc818e7af2b744a258"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 51,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 8,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 8,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 8,
      "hexagramName": "比",
      "poemText": "耋老鮐背，齒牙動搖。近地遠天，下入黃泉。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:bb5713b64e8e9a0d9ea51dc426f7d27bf10a1f3ff2e34aa51048673ddad7469a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c6a469d7d7f4f6aa582c3a7bafb2b69e981367f733079f7bef8f5b17509fb39c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 51,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 9,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 9,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 9,
      "hexagramName": "小畜",
      "poemText": "季蛇叔虎，野心善怒。黷貨無厭，以滅其身。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a575fd9dd9474c30be1d5ac0a786389b6372b21e9928bfc68db323f739f3c56b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:40358f48bdba0e012f58eaa893fd8b933ae8bc9a00ebefba574e1196d483ad9a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 51,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 10,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 10,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 10,
      "hexagramName": "履",
      "poemText": "訏疑八子，更相欺紿。管叔善政，不見邪期。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:81257134f0b398de1bd05a26151a1a9c3486534fcc93a261495bd464303acaea",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5bf406f466855bea23e78647cd4dddcd490b26d189a5e05ad5795479efa0246a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 51,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 11,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 11,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 11,
      "hexagramName": "泰",
      "poemText": "絆逃不遠，心與言反。尼丘顧家，茅簟朱華。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ce986971c6f7a30155b2cf20c6194763604a6baf154cfabdfb968628597bbfc0",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:cc28a169db6e5029b8a02d72bcb53855e04fac4cdf59113e4f8e42b0d4ecc9bb"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 51,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 12,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 12,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 12,
      "hexagramName": "否",
      "poemText": "蜉蝣戴盆，不能上山。搖推 跛，頓傷其顏。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e92243583b347560d06a220606772b3d90bf840f5fcf00fd3f5a5db018af828d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b7add4a25b85e391e0fe1703e6090174df8d50a7a45e70ad58207d2e3ab29721"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 51,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 13,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 13,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 13,
      "hexagramName": "同人",
      "poemText": "朝露不久，為恩惠少。膏澤欲盡，咎在枯槁。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:55db9ea1313176a3445a91b2f2e1d495aa83b6ac24880c6e5ebf4d5ad756d39e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a0e8277972cbd9c13c9026ae2dc3cadf3be0e1e78e8c04a618563c8f5fc265ef"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 51,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 14,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 14,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 14,
      "hexagramName": "大有",
      "poemText": "河伯之功，九州攸同。載祀六百，光烈無窮。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6a12dd360c280fc7648a3aec37e1b2b382cafd68941e9217c61d547ab22a20d9",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b1a5909bbcaa07f8b49d996768e7fdbf3b637c3a0bd92d590b1ecffdfd9ff510"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 51,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 15,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 15,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 15,
      "hexagramName": "謙",
      "poemText": "三人北行，大見光明。道逢淑女，與我驥子。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c6b924fd609798637fb10c89d56c1a0c2560e0412befcff5a8e3cac7825a09fd",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a87cc64a38f27d36d0cae9e58176d9804629d88f424c5d5c659095891807c4b4"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 51,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 16,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 16,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 16,
      "hexagramName": "豫",
      "poemText": "金精耀怒，帶劍過午。徘徊高庫，宿於木下。兩虎相距，弓弩滿野。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:891db945d0360b4d16b70e0c88d5152496669503f2adcbf7970417ead7b7b50d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9a42909532f57deee6af789445406ff48fd81cd46f3f3f9cef027ce6e55cfba1"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 51,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 17,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 17,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 17,
      "hexagramName": "隨",
      "poemText": "江河淮海，天之奧府。眾利所聚，可以富有。安樂無憂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:33b645c4ead197511daff9d894d211f4dad5bf8601ec38fc667d16a9302e0990",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:45f185cde7940c4c18512d9a32806cff5adf988e9eefd0e2844070d4e99d6a82"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 51,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 18,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 18,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 18,
      "hexagramName": "蠱",
      "poemText": "不虞之患，禍至此門。奄忽暴卒，病傷我心。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4fde74808eb4e241868ff462624358fff5c3de9751cc291bee01c5c558aab19c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:50a07fda57b11fb721a80a6a348f6ecd6d6ff3562cc4c454ae53397b00e6da79"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 51,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 19,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 19,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 19,
      "hexagramName": "臨",
      "poemText": "畫龍頭角，文章未成。甘言美語，說譯無名。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a53ae190d780e73854400c005b5ed4f391070dc51445f848e12af377ec340b07",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f232057e14c47664b06043526312dd15c24abca05df4a28457a31d01ebfe912a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 51,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 20,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 20,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 20,
      "hexagramName": "觀",
      "poemText": "缺破不成，胎卵不生，不見兆刑。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ec959a41005a9e7c8372a0d8b76a72af8669c7677f6e87d3c5795bf128531217",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:7f348f86b2284f0364464de321a5d2b8cd8b4824452fb430cdd24a5fdd61afd0"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 51,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 21,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 21,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 21,
      "hexagramName": "噬嗑",
      "poemText": "旁行不遠，三里反復。心多畏惡，日中止舍。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4ac6a556d19d46a816f1fbc0d3c8b3339043af3aa223d0869c38cdb0ff9d0547",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:87616fd7afecc3915e39f6d5124dab2467f94bf65c8e7e91b3c9ce3d29218c6d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 51,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 22,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 22,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 22,
      "hexagramName": "賁",
      "poemText": "四瀆不安，兵革為患。探我妻子，家復飢寒。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8a763d1b69477e491ad988f7246d684bd44f05f1b80b39117804d3beaa437e4e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:46eecbcc622e0a53fcda31dba204b93c5b19b515bf11b4b091cafd035f12ae9e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 51,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 23,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 23,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 23,
      "hexagramName": "剝",
      "poemText": "喜來如雲，舉家蒙歡。眾財君子，喜福盈門。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9839bce0c1725ec2f945feeb42194ef1ee2ecc8540a676ccacf65ff78a807217",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e8bfd57e1d048b7e8d01b22687b3b4cb71c9bf7413e928453aee5d61d1360859"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 51,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 24,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 24,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 24,
      "hexagramName": "復",
      "poemText": "載金販狗，利棄我走。藏匿淵底，拆晦為咎。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6827332fc00540a1eb24508d0d4a3ac97648388bd7eb6837b791eb0203461093",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:602a92d917df5011308dd8d0c20859a243bf41ee2743f3919fbe3e627a228860"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 51,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 25,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 25,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 25,
      "hexagramName": "无妄",
      "poemText": "日中為市，各抱所有。交易貲賄，函珠為寶。心悅歡喜。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:531fa4ae4228e3b2607ca49a68c5909783c82729136e73222f72b0a863aee851",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ba4102e25c02b8a73fbed45b617d1a48f221cc3beaca63066a4111c5b77b1604"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 51,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 26,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 26,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 26,
      "hexagramName": "大畜",
      "poemText": "日趨月步，周遍次舍。經歷致遠，無有難處。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:eaa079b45cf45037d33211dcfdbd64e1d842fa23571ad997cdc0dd392f88c47d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d3d7ff9ef9adc2012da9eb9573bd5c6832c402e6b5b9ffe44c9f64adfeb72b84"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 51,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 27,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 27,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 27,
      "hexagramName": "頤",
      "poemText": "陽明失時，陰凝為憂。主君哀泣，喪其元侯。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:261b0e27fd150e6a04483146709d04d01ed7252a79b309eddfef77a0cf659c84",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a967dc8fd7be332c837e78661a5734821ffba097bc41eac5fc65d14f36c79dd1"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 51,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 28,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 28,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 28,
      "hexagramName": "大過",
      "poemText": "年衰歲暮，精魂游去。形容消枯，哀子相呼。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:40c62289987cc1f1b008474c1bfac12ee29224fddf7e88c2f1c06406d7aa266b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b636ae3a962a7ede3533bea9fe804690902ff07e92bec11b728a7cb848e9c28f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 51,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 29,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 29,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 29,
      "hexagramName": "坎",
      "poemText": "少無功績，老困失福。跌行跛踦，不知所立。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:34ef0ed50802e53c34a0cbda26edf55ae7a28c9fda24a066875c5678a8372abd",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5c4a68ae29e8f0e66dc71510bed1fb8d17a920bec1d4385d525c04fefc49a584"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 51,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 30,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 30,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 30,
      "hexagramName": "離",
      "poemText": "持心耀目，善數搖動。自東徂西，不安其處。渙散府藏，無有利得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d15d98c42da21a432c3bd470a96be98b8ffe87402ff6d595642e4b522e87b052",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:0ce69397b1e73803ec3061e79593476aa282588ade265e44886cd6b3cb7261a2"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 51,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 31,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 31,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 31,
      "hexagramName": "咸",
      "poemText": "賫貝贖狸，不聽我辭。繫於虎鬚，牽不得來。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:cda0cdede2bac91fa14b16e4abd9a11b5f92e511e09de55575fb4ba52ff3b603",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:091106b0d074c350d7415cae929d4c6498c38d0d5af5b72f60a146fdbdb21852"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 51,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 32,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 32,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 32,
      "hexagramName": "恒",
      "poemText": "老狼白獹，長尾大胡。前顛後躓，岐人悅喜。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d2532fcd3c4de21e74708e535c9373a41288bbbb2ff1c67bab0d4c528c950ec7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:32391638092d9d8d601f8b8e8993fd19f7097c450f48a8830140f5278fb001fc"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 51,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 33,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 33,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 33,
      "hexagramName": "遯",
      "poemText": "背地相憎，心志不同。如火與金，君猛臣懾。虎行兔伏。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:dd7005d4d29a836956ef04bc3c4d0148d8bfa6bfc5cda5a455cb262af10f18ff",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:28f929afa8cac06c8d7baba56d9cef4e0d70d2f45bda690fe3c4a762342953ec"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 51,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 34,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 34,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 34,
      "hexagramName": "大壯",
      "poemText": "夏臺羑里，湯文厄處。鬼侯歠醢，岐人悅喜。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d51732705c7be2dedd95a9ab7b563a36086b4d67f74d1359e29e2c374cab1595",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3c0e5a0da2b947cee55dba2f8bc48aec7027fee69eaa4e836bec9f809ad45311"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 51,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 35,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 35,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 35,
      "hexagramName": "晉",
      "poemText": "牙 生齒，螳蜋啟戶。幽人利貞，鼓翼起舞。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8c3e7850f98dbef1ba2e639ae7e742d8255fab203afe55e183765a0c45a8d18c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:39fe2bf94c03346171c2348f3a96daf2459fada5676f8b35d66127ac0d19b0bf"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 51,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 36,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 36,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 36,
      "hexagramName": "明夷",
      "poemText": "烈女無夫，閔思苦憂。齊子無良，使我心愁。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7867d0d73588fa101d5efab4e80667eee672a7f7689dec02bef7c3ffbdb4e2d7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:bf971a5678ed971db69a82a95022cb3d706aa3b655ff5aa38533bf734c64f5df"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 51,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 37,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 37,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 37,
      "hexagramName": "家人",
      "poemText": "踐履危難，脫厄去患。入福喜門，見我大君。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:72792eaecdd3c2f1c6522c1c7566ecc61fdfdad22d267336f585ef345c5eca24",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:895f69e0719f402113a5550ccb36ed6a3e37444eedb9c3963e5c0e79081f675e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 51,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 38,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 38,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 38,
      "hexagramName": "睽",
      "poemText": "拆臂接手，不能進酒。析杞閑曠，神怒弗喜。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:970feb232f06c47b158de5d88c744e823c0f55b1abf23e2b04c8493ccb2d4990",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:287f7df438dff1cd1de91e81d76baf7442ac79074f2d56456fcf8620101c172e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 51,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 39,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 39,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 39,
      "hexagramName": "蹇",
      "poemText": "蟻封戶穴，大雨將集。鵲數起鳴，牝雞嘆室。相薨雄文，來到在道。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d05c97f6012c3a9d9a0e5f1e9215e111c168bc57a851df4fabafd4fa3e53a170",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f106c6c5bc5e5a5bbb357ade549fc44be6f4cde9668fdb4125e71b088f2057eb"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 51,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 40,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 40,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 40,
      "hexagramName": "解",
      "poemText": "胡俗戎狄，太陰所積。涸洌沍寒，君子不存。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:26cf0808dc608bcbd9f4944c13aa6a036ae0fc5cf884e23d9688df3185c56bdc",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e1c706e6ee4eadafed7ee71fc3d309b3c4e1b6bbe498ee12c511aef65fc34ca1"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 51,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 41,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 41,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 41,
      "hexagramName": "損",
      "poemText": "翕翕䡘䡘，稍頹崩顛。滅其令名，身不得全。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:043791b862c594285bca799e7386f7de08e9608663e959fd7999587dbc3e9650",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:cd80df3e692c3a4bd64a173f43408eba9a8ed610cb508bdb86fa2476cd007118"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 51,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 42,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 42,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 42,
      "hexagramName": "益",
      "poemText": "螟蟲為賊，害我稼穡。盡禾殫麥，秋無所得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:20924c5796e5efdb7e8bf144d9ef7f76aefe4ef5bd5167e3f0ed6f2b683a51da",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:43f7e60fcaeeb18476f34e2311507bcde9c8ea7b950ac8fc808a8dad41e022e6"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 51,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 43,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 43,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 43,
      "hexagramName": "夬",
      "poemText": "三鳥飛來，自我逢時。俱行先至，多得大利。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:2691f8ba0973833dfb204c4de10c0a63c1ce6b59587c0b049611f79be14de351",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9e372736bc3ca3f717d7a47e337942587c5db70f4207407a7fe1db26bb8179b7"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 51,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 44,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 44,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 44,
      "hexagramName": "姤",
      "poemText": "龍馬上山，絕無水泉。喉唇燋乾，渴不可言。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:fd11cefd9197e009d82931eff91cf86b21c5f7e2189534fb8a6ac5193e9006d8",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c0677d0c478a9e59224a91824e3d5fb11cffe8cf214124a803b56af72e8c37b0"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 51,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 45,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 45,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 45,
      "hexagramName": "萃",
      "poemText": "春生子乳，萬物蕃熾。君子所集，禍災不至。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f97f8a429763eb3893f3d9ea0bb49508a184a4c7a29d52b92d3436f55eededc6",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c9372f6d1f237a4d172a196a533e4aeff1af1185e98cc433dcc705bea8085b0b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 51,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 46,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 46,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 46,
      "hexagramName": "升",
      "poemText": "王孫季子，相與為友。明允篤誠，升擢薦舉。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3fc9bb1a7642a07583a59d3ab1a8f61043c9b7d0449f09046edcc76add392fc3",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2b5177947bd2f4f4cc72b5f6659fc3fa1bd8d230ae2d1e05d5323e073c89adc8"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 51,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 47,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 47,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 47,
      "hexagramName": "困",
      "poemText": "六明並照，政入有統。秦楚戰國，民受其咎。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:da851a1630e77c3875867e1772a9d40814c040baf4f9d1c72e9f71c6a5cabf88",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a52736f82ffeda8d6ad5e2fcb28a72e1eaecab9bb8278b76888f53501c5da129"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 51,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 48,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 48,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 48,
      "hexagramName": "井",
      "poemText": "蝃蝀充側， 人所惑。女謁橫行，正道壅塞。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:769843448498bb29f5184fa0c3d5acbdad0cf0da54d8e7163b795fcf759aa247",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:80095a33e6c792ad9010a6250e613cc891f9781ea7028a4ca8664db41d80cca8"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 51,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 49,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 49,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 49,
      "hexagramName": "革",
      "poemText": "登崑崙，入天門。過糟丘，宿玉泉。問惠觀，見仁君。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:79de1fe0b743ba416a8a3694e7ff7f791b4ab9e37ba4a3589cdd69c5e1e71712",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:bd7ea69fc49878f8153b5d998fd38ce906af2ec0592eb45f01644a6fb60b27a9"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 51,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 50,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 50,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 50,
      "hexagramName": "鼎",
      "poemText": "體重飛難，未能越關，不離空垣。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d96d8bb40cbadeb7edf5c66e529cf528deab7253ad212ca07c51a3d99932bc5a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:12bf0222d8d5a9b6b78ec10a6eb078bdf58206850424e39926ba8fee1e8ed29d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 51,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 52,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 52,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 52,
      "hexagramName": "艮",
      "poemText": "元黃虺隤，行者勞罷。役夫憔悴，踰時得歸。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0a45a01ad4c78e4a4f7f8260f0084010114a9f9e62cab66bac91401daf1482be",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:078ad09fdcfb4ec22d89831836603147007f3c712ef6e63cc46d8b377935f5d5"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 51,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 53,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 53,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 53,
      "hexagramName": "漸",
      "poemText": "孔德如玉，出於幽谷。飛上高木，鼓其羽翼。輝光照國。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1e8057c7eeb4bd9dd4781695cddb76222e95c68bcedcd739e4ae24b208af7a98",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:7f892f13bb4137aa12ad8dafdd22c4981f048d58d8bb9d2976f065686e959d93"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 51,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 54,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 54,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 54,
      "hexagramName": "歸妹",
      "poemText": "火雖熾，在吾後。寇雖眾，在吾右。身安吉，不危殆。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3269f075b581d3174f0b3c76081fe6dd814b668753dace702f3d5503517b6264",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2b37ae540c409bcf19dd21e5be100d0a87eb3bea536bcf7784c0649a8523cc49"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 51,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 55,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 55,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 55,
      "hexagramName": "豐",
      "poemText": "旃裘羶國，文禮不飾。跨馬控弦，伐我都邑。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:17dd7aac0aa9745b45f90dccce7ab9b23e4656c63536159b35ff26ac981f948a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:36eceba1185af6bd995449db149f44cb1302999ef22a4264e30eb7f10f06d6a9"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 51,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 56,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 56,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 56,
      "hexagramName": "旅",
      "poemText": "被髮八十，暮德獻服。邊鄙不聳，以安王國。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9f4be813f31948dd09e7bee7c1a6391cc71c29f4df7c170218c48758321eaadb",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e510d7ca9135e46089721ec887147c986647c960a7350f16cea14d94a9827feb"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 51,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 57,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 57,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 57,
      "hexagramName": "巽",
      "poemText": "心得所好，口常欲笑。公孫蛾眉，雞鳴樂夜。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:42082b1126e75022f700a3975c6a72316154df7031a709e8c31568d6345807a2",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:65c9b5842ce79b4b0f95d67eeed85b755aeee6f6d8881ffc1749876490598fa1"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 51,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 58,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 58,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 58,
      "hexagramName": "兌",
      "poemText": "馬西負乘，見邑之野。并獲粱稻，喜悅無咎。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:67bfe8feaddd601ed0beebaba1bf17f59ae17ecc10e8388409229772eea9c974",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2e688912a89dd4fde1edae49ccf7afe5c34af17685f595c2062d55bef7156f2d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 51,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 59,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 59,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 59,
      "hexagramName": "渙",
      "poemText": "高飛視下，貪饕所在。腐臭為患，害於躬身。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4d55af15843e133c457656d7aa85d8ee916a903527d382765aa06cf0fcfb6344",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d61cb26370ca9a1d1fe64e2c678fdba0df6e85820233bf6b9ca6949bc8c7e352"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 51,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 60,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 60,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 60,
      "hexagramName": "節",
      "poemText": "東行西步，失其次舍。乾侯野井，昭公喪居。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:bd9aaa417ca2dabb83bbb9ac9b716a15d46a4a9e550de62ab722448ff2fc491c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6dd040c672748986741baf7f5a7e4ae2ba9860267e6044653b98ce8240b97d5a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 51,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 61,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 61,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 61,
      "hexagramName": "中孚",
      "poemText": "神鳥五彩，鳳凰為主。集於山谷，使年歲育。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:83b0b34cde000f8f44fd4a180eb17a8ab2aa7034a77fc4b302b38910329f99a4",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d337acfacf05df39ffdc76169db4dd6414529a8f9c7bce94136b539dc345c733"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 51,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 62,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 62,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 62,
      "hexagramName": "小過",
      "poemText": "石門晨門，荷蕢食貧。遁世隱居，竟不逢時。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:12e0ea1c76fdd223020209b3b7d90f882f3903cc2b21c7572cbc2bb50c6dec9f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:564aacd9b9db38ad1e116d130ed289ae73b8ec5fab2cb1d48c8c21452cfe05cc"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 51,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 63,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 63,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 63,
      "hexagramName": "既濟",
      "poemText": "齧齧，貧鬼相責。無有懽怡，一日九結。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:cffe1d8cf5695d2f3cd3cf5e3f7f2c4d2e2dc7842e22d5137379a04c263f5b44",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c4c9b7d27f03dde0e97958f1469a1e273688aadf5db221ed29e41ae2bbc4c90a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 51,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 64,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 64,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 64,
      "hexagramName": "未濟",
      "poemText": "白日揚光，雷車避藏。雲雨不行，為止其鄉。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ae483d3f5ac803026dfdf89b64935a715dcf54dd842770c207a1f05737149fe8",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f547c1e3bfc0fab7abd930c17b34df028e345b41c31e384ced49b8ac924c21a7"
    }
  ]
}
